  "id": "hedonic-contrast",
  "term": "hedonic contrast",
  "definition": "Hedonic contrast is the relative change in pleasure or pain caused by a preceding or accompanying feeling state. It refers to how one feeling can make another seem more pleasant or more unpleasant by comparison.",
